      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To initiate the computer repair process, begin by examining the hardware."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening clause triggers the process start (init), describes initiating the process (n1), and specifies the first concrete step (n2)."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3",
        "guard:b1->n4",
        "action:n4",
        "guard:b1->n5",
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the hardware has been checked, proceed with repairing any issues that were identified."
      ],
      "justification": "Covers issue identification (n3), the decision split (b1), the positive guard for finding issues (b1->n4) with its repair action (n4), and the implicit negative guard/outcome (b1->n5, n5) when none are found."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n6",
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After the necessary repairs have been made, conclude the hardware inspection."
      ],
      "justification": "Both actions describe concluding the inspection phase following the initial hardware phase, covering both the repair and no-repair alternative paths."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Following the completion of the repair process, it is important to test the functionality of the system."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly maps to the system testing step described in the source."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9",
        "guard:b2->n10",
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the test results indicate that everything is functioning properly, then the hardware inspection process can be concluded."
      ],
      "justification": "The condition is modeled as an action step (n9) alongside the branch, positive guard, and conclusion action. Per modeling guidelines, paraphrasing a condition as an action preserves meaning and counts as a match."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n11",
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the test results indicate that there are still issues, then further hardware repairs are required."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps the negative test outcome guard and the corresponding further repair action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once these additional repairs have been made, the hardware inspection process can be concluded."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly maps to the final conclusion step after additional repairs."
    }
  ],
